w\/endpointIndices(ofEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/incidentEdgeIndices(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/incidentEdges(of:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/incidentEdges(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/neighborIndices(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/neighbors(of:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/oppositeVertex(to:acrossEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/vertex(atIndex:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/vertexIndex(of:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/IncidentEdges","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/NeighborIndices","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/Vertex"],"title":"Type Aliases","anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/Graph-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"IncidenceGraphView","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView.swift#L48","fileName":"IncidenceGraphView.swift"},"title":"IncidenceGraphView","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"IncidenceGraphView","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Hypergraphs"}],"externalID":"s:11Hypergraphs18IncidenceGraphViewV","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"An undirected hypergraph’s incidence graph, read lazily from its storage: a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Graph"},{"text":" on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0 ..< n + m"},{"text":" whose vertex ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"i < n"},{"text":" is the hypergraph’s vertex index ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"i"},{"text":" and whose vertex ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n + p"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is hyperedge ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"text":", with an edge ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"{i, n + p}"},{"text":" for each incidence. It is bipartite and simple","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(vertices on the left, hyperedges on the right), an empty hyperedge is an isolated vertex, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it loses nothing.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"IncidenceGraphView","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Base","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Base","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hypergraph","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Hypergraph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols10HypergraphP"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Edge position "},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is incidence number "},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": the incidences hyperedge by hyperedge, in index"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order, and within a hyperedge in "},{"code":"memberIndices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order. So "},{"code":"edges[q]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"UndirectedEdge(i, n + p)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the rows of the hyperedge side are contiguous ranges, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"per-incidence array (a weight of a vertex in a hyperedge) is indexed by edge position. A view is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a snapshot, so its own positions never change, but they are valid for the hypergraph only until"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its next mutation: the view of the mutated hypergraph numbers the incidences afresh (on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"IncidenceMatrix","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", inserting one cell shifts every later incidence by one), and a per-incidence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"array must be rebuilt for it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every index member reads the base’s rows: "},{"code":"neighborIndices(ofIndex: i)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"incidentHyperedgeIndices(ofIndex: i)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" shifted by n, and of "},{"code":"n + p","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"memberIndices(ofHyperedgeAt: p)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"code":"Traversal","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"Connectivity","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"ShortestPaths","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and the rest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"therefore run on the view without hashing a vertex. "},{"code":"_withIncidentIndexRows","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" writes the view’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rows out once per call from the base’s "},{"code":"_withIncidenceRows","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", in O(n + m + p), for whole-graph"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithms (components, bridges, cut vertices)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The view keeps each hyperedge’s first incidence number, so a hyperedge’s "},{"code":"incidentEdges","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"range, O(1). On "},{"code":"UndirectedIncidenceList","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which stores its incidences, every read is O(1) plus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the row. On any other base, "},{"code":"edges[q]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"endpointIndices(ofEdgeAt:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" binary-search the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hyperedge and find the member by its rank ("},{"code":"_memberIndex(atRank:…)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), O(log m + ⌈n\/64⌉) on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"IncidenceMatrix","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and O(log m + k) by default, and a vertex’s "},{"code":"incidentEdges","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" finds its place in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each of its hyperedges: O(d·⌈n\/64⌉) on "},{"code":"IncidenceMatrix","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which counts bits, and O(Σ k) over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them on a base without a faster "},{"code":"_memberRank","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BipartiteGraph(h.incidenceGraphView, left: 0 ..< h.vertexCount)"},{"text":" gives the bipartite structure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the view’s components restricted to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0 ..< n"},{"text":" are the hypergraph’s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/incidencegraphview"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/IncidenceGraphView/base":{"url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/incidencegraphview\/base","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"base","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The hypergraph."}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"base","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Base","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/base"},"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/IncidenceGraphView/vertexIndexBound":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/incidencegraphview\/vertexindexbound","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/vertexIndexBound","title":"vertexIndexBound","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"vertexIndexBound"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"abstract":[],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/IncidenceGraphView/NeighborIndices":{"kind":"symbol","title":"IncidenceGraphView.NeighborIndices","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"NeighborIndices"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"NeighborIndices"}],"identif